of hexo-theme-yun.",[18,19],"Astro","Welcome",[21],"Blog",false,true,"# Hello, Yun Astro! ☁️\n\nWelcome to the **Astro** version of [hexo-theme-yun](https://github.com/YunYouJun/hexo-theme-yun).\n\nThis is a minimal, fast, and beautiful blog theme powered by [Astro](https://astro.build).\n\n## Features\n\n- 🌙 Light / Dark / Sunset theme modes\n- 📁 Categories & Tags pages\n- 📅 Archives page\n- 🎨 Customizable via `src/config.ts`\n- ⚡ Zero-JS by default – scripts only where needed\n- 🔍 SEO-friendly with sitemap & Open Graph\n\n## Writing posts\n\nAdd `.md` or `.mdx` files to `src/content/posts/`:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: My Post Title\ndate: 2024-06-15\ntags: [Astro, Blog]\ncategories: [Tech]\ndescription: Short summary shown on the list page.\n---\n\nYour content here...\n```\n\n## Code highlighting\n\n```ts\nconst greet = (name: string) => `Hello, ${name}!`;\nconsole.log(greet('Yun'));\n```\n\nEnjoy writing! 🎉","src/content/posts/hello-world.md","2f28af67d8bd6079",{"html":28,"metadata":29},"\u003Ch1 id=\"hello-yun-astro-️\">Hello, Yun Astro! ☁️\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>Welcome to the \u003Cstrong>Astro\u003C/strong> version of \u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/YunYouJun/hexo-theme-yun\">hexo-theme-yun\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>This is a minimal, fast, and beautiful blog theme powered by \u003Ca href=\"https://astro.build\">Astro\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"features\">Features\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>🌙 Light / Dark / Sunset theme modes\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>📁 Categories &#x26; Tags pages\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>📅 Archives page\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>🎨 Customizable via \u003Ccode>src/config.ts\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>⚡ Zero-JS by default – scripts only where needed\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>🔍 SEO-friendly with sitemap &#x26; Open Graph\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"writing-posts\">Writing posts\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Add \u003Ccode>.md\u003C/code> or \u003Ccode>.mdx\u003C/code> files to \u003Ccode>src/content/posts/\u003C/code>:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-co